         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Siddons</hi>'s<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic"><hi rend="allcaps">Night</hi>.</hi><lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Last Time</hi> of Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Siddons</hi>'s acting.<lb/>
               Theatre Royal, Covent Garden,<lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Monday</hi>, <date when="1812-06-29">June 29 1812</date> will be acted Shakespeare's Tragedy of<lb/>
               <bibl><title><hi rend="allcaps">Macbeth.</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               The <hi rend="italic">Overture</hi> and <hi rend="italic">Symphonies</hi> between the Acts by <hi rend="italic">Mr. Ware</hi>-The Vocal Musick by Matthew Lock.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Duncan, King of Scotland,</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Murray</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Malcolm</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Claremont</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Donalbain</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Menage</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Macbeth</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kemble</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Macduff</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">C. Kemble</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Banquo</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barrymore</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Fleance</role> by <actor>Master <hi rend="allcaps">Chapman</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
